chFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t> 100 objects ( bucketed ) , HCA  - </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1300" dirty="0" err="1"><a:latin typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>upto</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1300" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t> 250 impacts (mandatory only – bucketed ) , S4 – </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1300" dirty="0" err="1"><a:latin typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>upto</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1300" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t> 250 impacts ( technically remediable only – bucketed ) </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="171450" lvl="2" indent="-171450"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="130000"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1300" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Development support to address issues that directly arise from the execution of mandatory code adjustments. </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" lvl="2" indent="0"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="130000"/></a:lnSpc><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1300" dirty="0"><a:highlight><a:srgbClr val="00FF00"/></a:highlight><a:latin typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" lvl="2" indent="0"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="130000"/></a:lnSpc><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1300" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Pre-Requisite</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="171450" lvl="2" indent="-171450"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="130000"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1300" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>An external NW7.52 system (or higher) should be available in the customer’s landscape in order to host an ATC scan based on check variant S4HANA_READINESS_2025 as part of prepare phase (before start of conversion) to validate custom code remediation scope</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="171450" lvl="2" indent="-171450"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="130000"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1300" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Custom code objects used actively in productive system (at least for a span of 6 months covering all critical processes )</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="171450" lvl="2" indent="-171450"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="130000"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1300" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" lvl="2" indent="0"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="130000"/></a:lnSpc><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1300" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Assumptions</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="171450" lvl="2" indent="-171450"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="130000"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1300" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>The current scope and efforts for mandatory code adjustments are based on relevant extracts available from the customer system. Any deviations from the baselined scope will be managed through a change request.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="171450" lvl="2" indent="-171450"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="130000"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1300" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>The customer is responsible for ensuring version correctness in the system provided for custom code activities. Mandatory code adjustments will be executed on the active version of the objects available in the designated system.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="171450" lvl="2" indent="-171450"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="130000"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1300" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Objects impacted during mandatory code adjustments that fall within third-party vendor namespaces (e.g., &lt;namespace&gt;) are expected to be reviewed and adjusted by the respective vendors. The customer is responsible for coordinating with these vendors to complete the necessary activities. </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="171450" lvl="2" indent="-171450"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="130000"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1300" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Any adjustments required due to dual maintenance or retrofit processes fall under the responsibility of the customer and are not included in the scope of mandatory code adjustments.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="171450" lvl="2" indent="-171450"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="130000"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1300" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>All relevant impacts related to HANA code adaptations and S/4 HANA will be addressed using Quick Fix and / or in-house  automation tools &amp; accelerators. </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="171450" lvl="2" indent="-171450"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="130000"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1300" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Documentation for remediated custom code will be generated using in-house automation toolset in a standardized format. </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="171450" lvl="2" indent="-171450"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="130000"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1300" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Mandatory code adjustment activities are scoped for one system only. All remediated objects will be transported to subsequent systems.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="171450" lvl="2" indent="-171450"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="130000"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1300" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>The development support does not extend in resolving pre-existing errors or bugs in custom code that are unrelated to the upgrade or remediation activities</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1300" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="1B3A6B"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>. </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="171450" lvl="2" indent="-171450"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="130000"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1300" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>SAP Queries, </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1300" dirty="0" err="1"><a:latin typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Infoset</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1300" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t> Queries, and ABAP Queries identified as impacted through ATC analysis are recommended for redevelopment by the customer. The scope, feasibility, and approach for such redevelopment will be discussed and finalized during the project execution phase. Any development support required to facilitate this effort may be undertaken through a Change Request.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="171450" lvl="2" indent="-171450"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="130000"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1300" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Any layout changes related to Adobe Forms / Smart Forms / Scripts Form are not included in the baseline scope. The effort will be  estimated based on customer requirements and will be addressed separately via a Change Request.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="171450" lvl="2" indent="-171450"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="130000"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1300" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Any new fit gap development work required to replicate functionality not supported in S/4HANA is excluded from the current scope and may be addressed separately via a Change Request.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="171450" lvl="2" indent="-171450"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="130000"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1300" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Effort related to Customer-Vendor Integration (CVI) within the custom code track is not included in the baseline scope. This effort will be assessed during the execution phase, based on the customer’s specific requirements, and can be covered through a separate Change Request.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" lvl="2" indent="0"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="130000"/></a:lnSpc><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1300" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" lvl="2" indent="0"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="130000"/></a:lnSpc><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1300" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Exclusions</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" lvl="2" indent="0"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="130000"/></a:lnSpc><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1300" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Any activities not defined as in scope  are deemed out of scope, including, but not limited to the following exclusions:</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="171450" lvl="2" indent="-171450"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="130000"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1300" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Any adjustments to custom code objects clones of  standard SAP objects , as identified through the  SAP clone finder scan results.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="171450" lvl="2" indent="-171450"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="130000"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1300" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>ATC impact category “Optional” or performance optimizations , including those related to variants FUNCTIONAL_DB_ADDITION or PERFORMANCE_DB variants in existing custom code.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="171450" lvl="2" indent="-171450"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="130000"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1300" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Any Screen variants / Transaction variants that are not carried forward by upgrade tool.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="171450" lvl="2" indent="-171450"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="130000"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1300" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Objects in package $TMP ( temporary or local objects ) or third party packages or objects with pre-existing syntax errors are excluded from all adjustment activities. </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" lvl="2" indent="0"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="130000"/></a:lnSpc><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="800" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Calibri" panose="020F0502020204030204" pitchFamily=